{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "flora_blocks_wild_seeds",
  "spec": ["flora 6.7.1", "flora 6.7.3", "flora 7", "flora 8"],
  "description": "Derived by hand from flora 6.7.1, 6.7.3 and 7 (tests 7 and 8 of 16). blocksPerMonth = ((cellsX * cellsZ) div period) >> 2: period 24: 64^2 -> 4096/24 = 170 -> 42; 128^2 -> 682 -> 170; 256^2 -> 2730 -> 682; period 6: 64^2 -> 682 -> 170; [choice] period 0 -> 0. Wild seeds = u32(trunc(f32(u32(trunc(w * sizeX))) * sizeZ)) >> 20: w 5, 1024 m -> 5242880 >> 20 = 5; 2048 m -> 20; 4096 m -> 80; w 0 -> 0. The monthly pass (shipped tuning, wild seeds 0): SimNewMonth sets today := data1 and, while enabled, visits blocksPerMonth blocks; with 1000 blocks the first month leaves the 1024-entry table at index 1000, the second visits 24, finds the iterator exhausted, resets it (1023 rand() calls, k unchanged) and visits 976 more (index 976). With 1024 blocks every block is visited once, so the one flora occupant (age 5000 >= lifespan) is reborn exactly once; disabled, a month only sets today. No generator draw happens with wild seeds 0. Wild seeding with w = 1 (scaled 1 * 1024 * 1024 >> 20 = 1) and blocksPerMonth 0: the type array is [A (never-auto), B]; draw 0 picks A (skipped, k unchanged), draw 1 picks B, then x = 100 and z = 200 (RandomUint32Uniform(1024) twice); DropSeed(B, 100, 200) passes the location test, score 0.6 >= 0.3 draws u = 0 (0 < 0.35, accepted) and plants B at (100, 260, 200) with one orientation draw. Propagation off, or the terrain not initialized, makes no wild draws.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blocks_per_month", "args": [64, 64, 24], "expect": 42},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blocks_per_month", "args": [128, 128, 24], "expect": 170},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blocks_per_month", "args": [256, 256, 24], "expect": 682},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blocks_per_month", "args": [64, 64, 6], "expect": 170},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blocks_per_month", "args": [64, 64, 0], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "scale_wild_seeds", "args": [5, 1024, 1024], "expect": 5},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "scale_wild_seeds", "args": [5, 2048, 2048], "expect": 20},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "scale_wild_seeds", "args": [5, 4096, 4096], "expect": 80},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "scale_wild_seeds", "args": [0, 1024, 1024], "expect": 0},

    {"op": "flora_types", "types": [{"type": "0x1000", "table": 0.6, "never_auto": true}, {"type": "0x2000", "table": 0.6}]},
    {"op": "flora_create", "crt_seed": 1},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"blocks_per_month": 42, "wild_seeds_per_month": 0}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_rand", "calls": 1023},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"blocks_per_month": 1000}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 100, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"today": 100, "iterator": {"index": 1000, "state": "running", "count": 1024}}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_rand", "calls": 0},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 130, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"today": 130, "iterator": {"index": 976, "state": "running", "count": 1024, "table_len": 1024}}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_rand", "calls": 1023},
    {"op": "flora_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "count": 0},

    {"op": "flora_env", "occupants": [{"id": 1, "type": "flora", "pos": [8, 260, 8], "flora_type": "0x2000", "birth": 0, "last_seed": 100000, "state": 2}]},
    {"op": "flora_create"},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"blocks_per_month": 1024}},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 5000, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "set_birth"}, "events": [{"event": "set_birth", "occupant": 1, "value": 5000}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"iterator": {"index": 1024, "state": "exhausted"}}},
    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"enabled": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 5030, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"today": 5030, "iterator": {"index": 1024, "state": "exhausted"}}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},

    {"op": "flora_tuning", "shipped": true, "props": {"0x085489C7": {"u32": 1}}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "ExemplarChanged", "data1": "0x7A4A8458", "data2": "0x1A2FDB6A", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"wild_seeds_per_month": 1, "blocks_per_month": 42}},
    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"blocks_per_month": 0, "enabled": true}},
    {"op": "flora_rng", "ints": [0, 1, 100, 200], "doubles": [0]},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 5060, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "events": [
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform_u32", "n": 2, "value": 0},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform_u32", "n": 2, "value": 1},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform_u32", "n": 1024, "value": 100},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform_u32", "n": 1024, "value": 200},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "range_i32", "lo": 0, "hi": 4, "value": 0}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1000, "exists": true, "in_manager": true, "flora_type": "0x2000", "pos": [100, 260, 200],
      "birth": 0, "last_seed": 0, "state": 0, "record": "0x2000"},
    {"op": "flora_rng", "ints": [1, 100, 200], "doubles": [0]},
    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"propagation": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 5090, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"propagation": true}},
    {"op": "flora_env", "terrain_initialized": false},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 5120, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "flora_env", "terrain_initialized": true},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "wild_seeds"},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "events": [{"method": "uniform_u32", "value": 1}, {"method": "uniform_u32", "value": 100}, {"method": "uniform_u32", "value": 200}], "note": "the seed lands on the tree planted before: location not OK, no acceptance draw"}
  ]
}
